{
  "page": 264,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 1834,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) berfirman, \"Wahai Iblis! Apa sebabnya kamu (tidak ikut) sujud bersama mereka?\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1835,
      "text": "Ia (Iblis) berkata, \"Aku sekali-kali tidak akan sujud kepada manusia yang Engkau telah menciptakannya dari tanah liat kering dari lumpur hitam yang diberi bentuk.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1836,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) berfirman, \"(Kalau begitu) keluarlah dari surga, karena sesungguhnya kamu terkutuk,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1837,
      "text": "dan sesungguhnya kutukan itu tetap menimpamu sampai hari Kiamat.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1838,
      "text": "Ia (Iblis) berkata, \"Ya Tuhanku, (kalau begitu) maka berilah penangguhan kepadaku sampai hari (manusia) dibangkitkan.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1839,
      "text": "Allah berfirman, \"(Baiklah) maka sesungguhnya kamu termasuk yang diberi penangguhan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1840,
      "text": "sampai hari yang telah ditentukan (Kiamat).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1841,
      "text": "Ia (Iblis) berkata, \"Tuhanku, oleh karena Engkau telah memutuskan bahwa aku sesat, aku pasti akan jadikan (kejahatan) tampak indah bagi mereka di bumi, dan aku akan menyesatkan mereka semuanya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1842,
      "text": "kecuali hamba-hamba-Mu yang terpilih di antara mereka.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1843,
      "text": "Dia (Allah) berfirman, \"Ini adalah jalan yang lurus (menuju) kepada-Ku.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1844,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya kamu (Iblis) tidak kuasa atas hamba-hamba-Ku, kecuali mereka yang mengikutimu, yaitu orang yang sesat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1845,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, Jahanam itu benar-benar (tempat) yang telah dijanjikan untuk mereka (pengikut setan) semuanya,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1846,
      "text": "(Jahanam) itu mempunyai tujuh pintu. Setiap pintu (telah ditetapkan) untuk golongan tertentu dari mereka.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 220,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1847,
      "text": "Sesungguhnya orang yang bertakwa itu berada dalam surga-surga (taman-taman) dan (di dekat) mata air (yang mengalir).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1848,
      "text": "(Allah berfirman), \"Masuklah ke dalamnya dengan sejahtera dan aman.\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1849,
      "text": "Dan Kami lenyapkan segala rasa dendam yang ada dalam hati mereka; mereka merasa bersaudara, duduk berhadap-hadapan di atas dipan-dipan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1850,
      "text": "Mereka tidak merasa lelah di dalamnya dan mereka tidak akan dikeluarkan darinya.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1851,
      "text": "Kabarkanlah kepada hamba-hamba-Ku, bahwa Akulah Yang Maha Pengampun, Maha Penyayang,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 105,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1852,
      "text": "dan sesungguhnya azab-Ku adalah azab yang sangat pedih.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1853,
      "text": "Dan kabarkanlah (Muhammad) kepada mereka tentang tamu Ibrahim (malaikat).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 264,
      "ruku": 221,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
